WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.460
Two friends from different cities talk about everyday life.

2
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.150
Dzieci bawią się na dworze.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.940
In Warsaw and most of Poland.

4
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.270
Dzieci bawią się na polu.

5
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.660
In Kraków, the same sentence.

6
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.070
Na obiad są ziemniaki.

7
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.960
Na obiad są pyry z gzikiem.

8
00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:29.710
And in Poznań, potatoes have their own name.

9
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.340
Na obiad są kartofle.

10
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:38.980
Standard Polish is understood everywhere.

11
00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.490
Regional words are easy to recognise once you know them.

12
00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.570
Standard Polish: the children are playing outside.

13
00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.910
Dzieci bawią się na dworze.

14
